# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# StudyFlow AI — CLIENT environment template
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.
# NEVER put secrets here — anything bundled into the client is PUBLIC.
# Pricing is controlled by the admin panel, so no pricing vars are needed.
#
# The client currently requires NO environment variables: in dev, /api/* is
# proxied to the server via client/vite.config.js.
#
# (Optional, future) If you serve the client from a different origin than the
# API, you could introduce a public base URL here — e.g.:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
